msgid "SLC extraction"
msgstr "SLC 提取"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:87
msgid ""
"Sentinel-1 IW SLC spans 3 sub-swaths per polarisation; your AOI typically "
"falls in just one, and which one varies per scene. `SLCExtractor` reads each"
" sub-swath's embedded GCPs via rasterio and picks the one that overlaps your"
" AOI."
msgstr ""
"Sentinel-1 IW SLC 每种极化跨越 3 个子条带；你的 AOI 通常只落在其中一个，具体是哪一个因场景而异。`SLCExtractor` "
"通过 rasterio 读取每个子条带的内嵌 GCP，并选出与你的 AOI 重叠的那一个。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:92
msgid ""
"Passing a `DownloadResult` object (rather than a raw path) is preferred — "
"`extract_pair()` reads `.output_path` directly, avoiding filename/subfolder "
"mismatch bugs."
msgstr ""
"优先传入 `DownloadResult` 对象（而不是原始路径）——`extract_pair()` 会直接读取 "
"`.output_path`，避免文件名/子文件夹不匹配的 bug。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:96
msgid "Interferogram generation"
msgstr "干涉图生成"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:98
msgid ""
"`InterferogramGenerator.process_pair()` handles GDAL's `complex_int16` dtype"
" — the actual format Sentinel-1 SLC TIFFs use, not just "
"`complex64`/`complex128`. Missing this silently discards phase data."
msgstr ""
"`InterferogramGenerator.process_pair()` 能处理 GDAL 的 `complex_int16` 数据类型——这是 "
"Sentinel-1 SLC TIFF 实际使用的格式，而不仅仅是 "
"`complex64`/`complex128`。遗漏这一点会在无提示的情况下丢弃相位数据。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:102
msgid ""
"Topographic phase removal is R²-gated (> 0.5) so deformation signal isn't "
"mistaken for terrain phase."
msgstr "地形相位去除由 R² 控制（> 0.5），这样形变信号不会被误当作地形相位。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:105
msgid "Phase unwrapping"
msgstr "相位解缠"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:107
msgid ""
"SNAPHU (Chen & Zebker 2001) via `snaphu-py` — the same algorithm ASF's On-"
"Demand InSAR and ISCE2/3 use in production."
msgstr ""
"通过 `snaphu-py` 使用 SNAPHU（Chen & Zebker 2001）——与 ASF 的 On-Demand InSAR 和 "
"ISCE2/3 在生产环境中使用的算法相同。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:110
msgid "SBAS time series"
msgstr "SBAS 时间序列"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:112
msgid ""
"Berardino et al. (2002) SBAS inversion, with optional MintPy delegation for "
"the full correction chain."
msgstr "Berardino 等（2002）的 SBAS 反演，可选择委托 MintPy 完成完整的校正链。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:117
msgid ""
"**The reference pixel matters more than almost anything else here.** Phase "
"unwrapping only recovers phase relative to an arbitrary per-interferogram "
"offset. Combining unwrapped interferograms without a common, stable "
"reference pixel corrupts the entire result. In one verification run, "
"referencing inside a synthetic subsidence bowl gave 103 mm/yr RMSE against a"
" 100 mm/yr true signal; a verified-stable reference gave 8.84 mm/yr RMSE. "
"Always pass an explicit, independently-verified `reference_pixel`."
msgstr ""
"**在这里，参考像元几乎比任何其他因素都更重要。** "
"相位解缠只能恢复相对于每幅干涉图任意偏移量的相位。在没有共同的、稳定的参考像元的情况下组合解缠后的干涉图，会破坏整个结果。在一次验证运行中，在合成沉降盆地内部做参考，对于"
" 100 mm/年的真实信号给出了 103 mm/年的 RMSE；而经验证稳定的参考则给出 8.84 mm/年的 "
"RMSE。请始终传入一个明确的、经独立验证的 `reference_pixel`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:126
msgid ""
"Advanced safeguards: custom DEMs, layover/shadow, and topographic residuals"
msgstr "高级保护措施：自定义 DEM、叠掩/阴影和地形残差"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:128
msgid ""
"`pygeofetch.insar.advanced_safeguards` adds three general-purpose "
"capabilities — general-purpose meaning exactly that: the physics here "
"applies identically to a volcanic edifice, mountainous landslide terrain, a "
"high-relief urban area, or an open-pit mine. None of it is mining-specific, "
"even though this project's own validation work happens to use a mine as its "
"stress test."
msgstr ""
"`pygeofetch.insar.advanced_safeguards` "
"增加了三项通用能力——通用的意思就是字面意思：这里的物理原理同样适用于火山锥、山区滑坡地形、高起伏的城市地区或露天矿。其中没有任何内容是针对采矿的，尽管本项目自身的验证工作恰好以一处矿山作为压力测试。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:135
msgid ""
"These three functions belong to different stages of the real InSAR chain, "
"stated explicitly because conflating them is an easy mistake:"
msgstr "这三个函数属于真实 InSAR 处理链的不同阶段，特意明确说明，因为把它们混为一谈是很容易犯的错误："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:139
msgid "`prepare_custom_dem` — before interferogram generation"
msgstr "`prepare_custom_dem`——在干涉图生成之前"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:141
msgid ""
"Aligns a custom, high-resolution DEM (UAV photogrammetry, airborne LiDAR) to"
" a reference SAR raster's exact grid via `rasterio.warp.reproject`, for "
"topographic-phase removal during interferogram formation. Useful when a "
"coarse global DEM (SRTM, Copernicus DEM) under-resolves terrain — a UAV DEM "
"over an active volcanic crater, LiDAR over a landslide body, or a high-"
"resolution urban DSM."
msgstr ""
"通过 `rasterio.warp.reproject` 将自定义的高分辨率 DEM（无人机摄影测量、机载 LiDAR）对齐到参考 SAR "
"栅格的精确网格，用于在干涉图形成期间去除地形相位。当粗分辨率的全球 DEM（SRTM、Copernicus "
"DEM）无法充分分辨地形时很有用——例如活火山口上的无人机 DEM、滑坡体上的 LiDAR，或高分辨率的城市 DSM。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:159
msgid "`generate_insar_mask` — before interferogram generation"
msgstr "`generate_insar_mask`——在干涉图生成之前"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:161
msgid ""
"geometry-based layover/shadow masking from a DEM and the real acquisition "
"geometry (incidence angle, heading, look side) — flags which pixels are "
"structurally unusable for InSAR *before* any interferogram is even formed, "
"independent of coherence."
msgstr ""
"基于 DEM 和真实采集几何（入射角、航向、视向侧）的几何叠掩/阴影掩膜——在甚至还没有形成任何干涉图*之前*，就标记出哪些像元在结构上无法用于 "
"InSAR，与相干性无关。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:177
msgid ""
"The physics: a pixel is in **layover** when local terrain slope toward the "
"radar is steep enough that the local incidence angle drops to zero or below "
"(the near-range part of the slope arrives at the sensor before the far-range"
" part, folding the image over itself), and in **shadow** when slope facing "
"away from the radar pushes the local incidence angle to 90° or beyond (the "
"radar beam physically can't reach it). Verified against a synthetic cone "
"DEM: a steep cone (76° slope vs. 35° incidence) correctly shows layover on "
"the radar-facing flank *and* shadow on the opposite flank simultaneously; a "
"gentler cone (31° slope, below the incidence angle) correctly shows neither."
msgstr ""
"物理原理：当朝向雷达的局部地形坡度陡到使局部入射角降到零或以下时，像元处于**叠掩**（斜坡近距部分先于远距部分到达传感器，使影像自身折叠）；当背向雷达的坡度使局部入射角达到"
" 90° 或更大时，像元处于**阴影**（雷达波束在物理上无法到达）。已用合成圆锥 DEM 验证：陡峭的圆锥（76° 坡度对 35° "
"入射角）正确地在面向雷达的一侧显示叠掩，*同时*在相反一侧显示阴影；较平缓的圆锥（31° 坡度，低于入射角）则正确地两者都不显示。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:188
msgid ""
"`build_sbas_design_matrix_with_topo` — during SBAS inversion, after "
"unwrapping"
msgstr "`build_sbas_design_matrix_with_topo`——在 SBAS 反演期间，解缠之后"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:190
msgid ""
"This is standard residual DEM-error co-estimation (Berardino et al. 2002; "
"Fattahi & Amelung 2013), applied to the *already unwrapped* phase stack — "
"not topographic phase removal, which already happened earlier using whatever"
" DEM the interferogram stage used. This corrects for the *residual* error "
"left over in that earlier DEM, a real, separate, later correction."
msgstr ""
"这是标准的残余 DEM 误差联合估计（Berardino 等 2002；Fattahi & Amelung "
"2013），应用于*已经解缠*的相位堆栈——不是地形相位去除，后者早已使用干涉图阶段所用的任何 DEM 完成。它校正的是早先那个 DEM "
"中遗留的*残余*误差，这是一项真实、独立、靠后的校正。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:211
msgid ""
"Real physics: a residual DEM error `epsilon` contributes phase `(4π/λ) × "
"(B_perp / (R·sin θ)) × epsilon`, linear in `epsilon` exactly like the "
"familiar velocity term is linear in time — which is why both can be solved "
"for jointly in one linear least-squares system per pixel. The topographic-"
"residual column added here has been checked against this exact analytical "
"formula to machine precision, not just \"does it run.\""
msgstr ""
"真实的物理原理：残余 DEM 误差 `epsilon` 贡献的相位为 `(4π/λ) × (B_perp / (R·sin θ)) × "
"epsilon`，对 `epsilon` "
"是线性的，正如常见的速度项对时间是线性的一样——因此两者可以在每个像元的一个线性最小二乘系统中联合求解。此处添加的地形残差列已经对照这个精确的解析公式检查到机器精度，而不仅仅是“能不能运行”。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:219
msgid "Atmospheric correction"
msgstr "大气校正"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:221
msgid ""
"Elevation-correlated (no extra deps, same R²-gating), or ERA5-based via "
"PyAPS (`pygeofetch[insar-full]`, needs free CDS API credentials)."
msgstr ""
"与高程相关的方法（无需额外依赖，同样由 R² 控制），或通过 PyAPS 使用基于 ERA5 的方法（`pygeofetch[insar-"
"full]`，需要免费的 CDS API 凭据）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:224
msgid "Orbit files"
msgstr "轨道文件"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:233
msgid ""
"Served by ESA as `.EOF.zip`; extraction is automatic and always returns a "
"directly-usable `.EOF` path."
msgstr "由 ESA 以 `.EOF.zip` 提供；提取是自动的，并且始终返回可直接使用的 `.EOF` 路径。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:236
msgid "Data validation"
msgstr "数据验证"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:238
msgid ""
"`DataValidator` runs automatically at pipeline entry points, not just "
"available-but-unused: input SLC sanity checks (complex dtype, NaN, dynamic "
"range) at the start of every `process_pair()` call, coherence range checks "
"after estimation, and SBAS network connectivity checks before the expensive "
"inversion runs."
msgstr ""
"`DataValidator` 在流程入口点自动运行，而不仅仅是“可用但未被使用”：在每次 `process_pair()` 调用开始时检查输入 SLC"
" 的合理性（复数数据类型、NaN、动态范围），在估计之后检查相干性范围，并在代价高昂的反演运行之前检查 SBAS 网络连通性。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:251
msgid ""
"Catches a failure mode a naive dtype check misses: amplitude-only data cast "
"to a complex dtype (`+ 0j`) passes both the dtype check and the amplitude-"
"variation check — it's `complex64`, and amplitude does vary. The validator "
"specifically checks for near-zero imaginary part everywhere, which SAR phase"
" never has."
msgstr ""
"捕捉朴素 dtype 检查会漏掉的一种失效模式：仅含振幅的数据被转换为复数 dtype（`+ 0j`）后，既能通过 dtype "
"检查，也能通过振幅变化检查——它是 `complex64`，而且振幅确实有变化。该验证器会专门检查各处的虚部是否接近零，而 SAR 相位绝不会如此。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:257
msgid "Real orbit-based coregistration"
msgstr "基于真实轨道的配准"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:259
msgid ""
"TOPS mode needs ~0.001-pixel coregistration accuracy (Yagüe-Martínez et al. "
"2016) — orbit-based geometric coregistration is the proven method for "
"reaching it, not a shape-matching guess. Ground points are sampled directly "
"from a DEM's own geographic coordinates (closed-form, always converges) and "
"located in both orbits via a zero-Doppler time solve."
msgstr ""
"TOPS 模式需要约 0.001 像元的配准精度（Yagüe-Martínez et al. "
"2016）——基于轨道的几何配准是达到该精度的成熟方法，而不是靠形状匹配的猜测。地面点直接从 DEM "
"自身的地理坐标中采样（闭式解，始终收敛），并通过零多普勒时间求解在两条轨道中定位。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:279
msgid ""
"Supply all four (plus a DEM) and orbit-based coregistration is used "
"automatically. Omit any of the four and it falls back cleanly to shape-based"
" resampling, with a clear log line stating which path ran."
msgstr ""
"提供全部四项（外加 DEM）时，会自动使用基于轨道的配准。省略其中任何一项，则会平稳回退到基于形状的重采样，并通过清晰的日志行说明实际运行的是哪条路径。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:285
msgid ""
"**Limitation.** The lower-level `solve_ground_point()` (an alternative, "
"pixel-driven geolocation solve) has a known reliability gap and is "
"deliberately not exported as a primary API. It fails safely, but is not "
"recommended for unattended use."
msgstr ""
"**局限。** 较底层的 `solve_ground_point()`（一种替代的、按像元驱动的地理定位求解）存在已知的可靠性缺陷，因此有意不作为主要 "
"API 导出。它会安全地失败，但不建议用于无人值守的场景。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:289
msgid "LOS-to-vertical conversion"
msgstr "LOS 到垂直方向的转换"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:291
msgid ""
"InSAR measures line-of-sight range change — the true 3D displacement vector "
"projected onto the satellite's single viewing direction. With one geometry, "
"that's one equation and three unknowns. `los_to_vertical_displacement()` "
"applies the standard literature technique (Fialko et al. 2001; Hooper et al."
" 2012): assume horizontal motion is negligible."
msgstr ""
"InSAR "
"测量的是视线向距离变化——即真实三维位移矢量在卫星单一观测方向上的投影。仅有一种几何时，这就是一个方程、三个未知数。`los_to_vertical_displacement()`"
" 采用文献中的标准做法（Fialko et al. 2001；Hooper et al. 2012）：假设水平运动可以忽略不计。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:306
msgid ""
"This is an assumption, not a measurement — defensible for vertically-"
"dominated sources like mining/groundwater subsidence, actively wrong for "
"landslides or fault creep with a lateral component. Sentinel-1's near-polar "
"orbit is also nearly blind to north-south motion regardless of this "
"conversion."
msgstr ""
"这是一个假设，而不是测量结果——对于采矿/地下水沉降等以垂直运动为主的来源是站得住脚的，但对于带有侧向分量的滑坡或断层蠕动则是错误的。此外，无论采用何种转换，Sentinel-1"
" 的近极轨轨道对南北向运动几乎不敏感。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:312
msgid "Automatic visualization"
msgstr "自动可视化"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:319
msgid ""
"A visualization failure only logs a warning — it never blocks or loses the "
"actual GeoTIFF output."
msgstr "可视化失败只会记录一条警告——绝不会阻塞或丢失实际的 GeoTIFF 输出。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:322
msgid "GPU acceleration"
msgstr "GPU 加速"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:328
msgid ""
"Optional CuPy backend for coherence estimation and SBAS inversion's large "
"matrix solve. `use_gpu` defaults to `False` — opt-in, not opt-out."
msgstr ""
"可选的 CuPy 后端，用于相干性估计和 SBAS 反演中的大型矩阵求解。`use_gpu` 默认为 `False`——需要主动开启，而不是主动关闭。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:332
msgid "Risk mapping with uncertainty quantification"
msgstr "带不确定性量化的风险制图"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:348
msgid ""
"Four distinct uncertainty-quantification methods, not one formula presented "
"four ways:"
msgstr "四种不同的不确定性量化方法，而不是同一个公式的四种呈现方式："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "`method=`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "Real basis"
msgstr "真实依据"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "`\"bayesian\"` (default)"
msgstr "`\"bayesian\"`（默认）"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "Conjugate Normal-Normal Bayesian update on the trend/slope"
msgstr "对趋势/斜率进行共轭 Normal-Normal 贝叶斯更新"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "`\"monte_carlo\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "Monte Carlo simulation, `n_simulations` draws"
msgstr "蒙特卡罗模拟，抽取 `n_simulations` 次"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "`\"bootstrap\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid ""
"**Residual** bootstrap resampling — not naive time-index resampling, which "
"would double-count temporal autocorrelation in the residuals"
msgstr "**残差**自助法重采样——而不是朴素的时间索引重采样，后者会重复计入残差中的时间自相关"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "`\"analytical\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:283
msgid "Closed-form analytical uncertainty propagation"
msgstr "闭式解析不确定性传播"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:358
msgid ""
"`risk_function` defaults to a trend-magnitude-over-variability ratio but "
"accepts any `(data_array, time_years) -> risk_array` callable, so a domain-"
"specific risk definition (e.g. weighting recent acceleration more heavily) "
"can be substituted directly."
msgstr ""
"`risk_function` 默认为趋势幅度与变异性之比，但可接受任何 `(data_array, time_years) -> "
"risk_array` 可调用对象，因此可以直接替换为特定领域的风险定义（例如对近期加速度赋予更高权重）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:365
msgid ""
"`RiskMapper.__init__` does not modify the `ts_result` you pass in, so the "
"same object can be reused safely afterwards."
msgstr "`RiskMapper.__init__` 不会修改你传入的 `ts_result`，因此之后可以放心地继续复用同一个对象。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:368
msgid ""
"`RiskMapper` accepts a `TimeSeriesResult` from `SBASTimeSeries.invert()` "
"directly (matches its `.displacement`/`.dates` attributes), or any "
"object/dict exposing a 3D `(time, y, x)` array under one of "
"`data`/`displacement`/`deformation`/`timeseries`/`stack` and a matching per-"
"time-step label under one of "
"`times`/`dates`/`time`/`date`/`acquisition_dates`/`date_list`."
msgstr ""
"`RiskMapper` 可直接接受来自 `SBASTimeSeries.invert()` 的 `TimeSeriesResult`（与其 "
"`.displacement`/`.dates` 属性匹配），也可接受任何对象/字典，只要它在 "
"`data`/`displacement`/`deformation`/`timeseries`/`stack` 之一下提供三维 `(time, y, "
"x)` 数组，并在 `times`/`dates`/`time`/`date`/`acquisition_dates`/`date_list` "
"之一下提供与之对应的逐时间步标签。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:375
msgid ""
"`validate_risk_map()` compares a computed risk map against real ground truth"
" or reference data — `rmse`, `mae`, `r2` for accuracy, plus `coverage` and "
"`sharpness` for calibration quality (does the stated confidence interval "
"actually contain the true value the stated fraction of the time, and how "
"tight is it)."
msgstr ""
"`validate_risk_map()` 将计算得到的风险图与真实的地面实况或参考数据进行比较——用 `rmse`、`mae`、`r2` "
"衡量精度，并用 `coverage` 和 `sharpness` 衡量校准质量（所声明的置信区间是否确实在所声明的比例上包含真值，以及区间有多窄）。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:381
msgid "InSARProject — search to interferogram in a handful of calls"
msgstr "InSARProject——只需几次调用，从搜索到干涉图"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:383
msgid ""
"A high-level workflow wrapper for the full search → download → extract → "
"interferogram chain, built on the verified lower-level pieces above."
msgstr "一个高层工作流封装，覆盖完整的搜索 → 下载 → 提取 → 干涉图链路，基于上文已验证的较底层组件构建。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/processing/sar-insar/insar.md:401
msgid ""
"If you want every burst-aware ESD, flat-earth, and unwrapping step fully "
"explicit instead of wrapped inside this convenience layer, use "
"`SLCExtractor` / `InterferogramGenerator` directly."
msgstr ""
"如果你希望把所有突发感知的 ESD、平地效应和解缠步骤完全显式地控制，而不是包裹在这层便捷封装之内，请直接使用 `SLCExtractor` / "
"`InterferogramGenerator`。"
